{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floramino is a dynamic tiling puzzle game where your tiles are flowers in a garden! Pick which flowers to add to your collection, and arrange them in your compact plot to fulfill requests from your community and grow your budding florist business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/f61198aa94136f306b697904dc24ce75.poster.avif?t=1763450923\" width=750 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/f61198aa94136f306b697904dc24ce75.webm?t=1763450923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/f61198aa94136f306b697904dc24ce75.mp4?t=1763450923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan Your Garden</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate and fit flower tiles together to make the most of your limited garden space!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As new requests come in, rearrange and update your layout to make sure all flowers have room to grow.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully combat weeds without harming your flowers!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With randomized orders and flower upgrades, the puzzle continuously evolves as you play.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/d0c437b0d3a3a5c75e56c4b9abfe1c02.poster.avif?t=1763450923\" width=1170 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/d0c437b0d3a3a5c75e56c4b9abfe1c02.webm?t=1763450923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover New Places</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 8 hand-drawn maps, each with unique tile layouts to puzzle!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize and find the best flower combinations for each plot layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of charming characters, fulfill quests, and encounter random and area-based events! (coming soon in the full release)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/1a552f272041e36dba006d6d4741dc35.poster.avif?t=1763450923\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/1a552f272041e36dba006d6d4741dc35.webm?t=1763450923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/1a552f272041e36dba006d6d4741dc35.mp4?t=1763450923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Inventory</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch up your strategy as you unlock new and rare seeds. Find the best combination of flowers to take you to success!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather tools and upgrades to make your garden more efficient, and craft a different build with each playthrough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/5db7393d177359662e1545fccc2215b5.poster.avif?t=1763450923\" width=1170 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/5db7393d177359662e1545fccc2215b5.webm?t=1763450923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/5db7393d177359662e1545fccc2215b5.mp4?t=1763450923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Your Favorite Playstyle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:\u00a0</strong>Play as a traveling florist on a mission to save springtime! In a replayable campaign mode, journey through the realm and discover the secret of why spring has been so fleeting. Explore the world, collect different plants, and meet lots of friendly faces as you go!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:\u00a0</strong>Pick your favorite plot and seeds and grow to your heart's content! Peacefully tend to your garden, practice your best strategies, or go for the biggest numbers - pick a ruleset that works for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999350?t=1763450923","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/8506936eedcec4ad2b7550584284b90cc23ca4d4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763450923","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/d798075fe7fc7faff6ccd96038f492bc7bf8fcaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763450923","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/d798075fe7fc7faff6ccd96038f492bc7bf8fcaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763450923","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4141700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floramino is a dynamic tiling puzzle game where your tiles are flowers in a garden! Pick which flowers to add to your collection, and arrange them in your compact plot to fulfill requests from your community and grow your budding florist business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/f61198aa94136f306b697904dc24ce75.poster.avif?t=1763450923\" width=750 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/f61198aa94136f306b697904dc24ce75.webm?t=1763450923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/f61198aa94136f306b697904dc24ce75.mp4?t=1763450923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan Your Garden</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate and fit flower tiles together to make the most of your limited garden space!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As new requests come in, rearrange and update your layout to make sure all flowers have room to grow.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully combat weeds without harming your flowers!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With randomized orders and flower upgrades, the puzzle continuously evolves as you play.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/d0c437b0d3a3a5c75e56c4b9abfe1c02.poster.avif?t=1763450923\" width=1170 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999350/extras/d0c437b0d3a3a5c75e56c4b9abfe1c02.webm?t=1763450923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover New Places</h2><ul class=